#: scenario8:scenario8_17527806_B238_4C61_8539_8CC86EDB4A37
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c47f55bb93ceff52ac6ccd5e6342c056a1c685788eaa23ff183333d55ee8d717
#. default-sha256: 4f6c493057fa7f862df60732210d5e1383a7731d464203aba0ad18da8a4fc9ad
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_17527806_B238_4C61_8539_8CC86EDB4A37"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫I’m staring into "
"a pair of ruby red eyes, open wide with shock.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫I recall snapping at him, "
"insulting him, but I don’t remember what I said.⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫Nor do I remember how he "
"responded.⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫All I know is that a wave of churning blackness appeared out of "
"nowhere, ⟪k:24⟫washing me away.⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫I’m powerless.⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫Helpless.⟪k:31⟫"
"⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫Hopeless.⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫My young mind sucked into it like a whirlpool."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Mi ritrovo a "
"fissare un paio di occhi color rosso rubino, spalancati per lo stupore.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Ricordo "
"di avergli urlato contro, di averlo insultato, ma non ricordo cosa io gli abbia detto.⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫"
"⟪k:20⟫Né tantomeno cosa lui mi abbia risposto.⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫Tutto quello che so è che una "
"travolgente ondata d’oscurità è apparsa fuori dal nulla, ⟪k:24⟫spazzandomi via.⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫"
"Sono impotente.⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫Inerme.⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫Senza speranze.⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫La mia "
"giovane mente viene come risucchiata in un vortice."

#: scenario8:scenario8_F8B2A1AC_C883_43F2_8F6F_F1E7315C405F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7ba7d62aa5c4ff30c8f2250f985d81ca983a6d4053a14a820dfcd14fd1814995
#. default-sha256: a7c95ab00738f4e6e8e156247e54a684d0027796a8a1d53164fb9852f25e4747
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F8B2A1AC_C883_43F2_8F6F_F1E7315C405F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Young”? ⟪k:1⟫My ⟪k:2⟫young⟪k:3⟫ mind?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Oh, for Christ’s sake. ⟪k:7⟫You have "
"⟪k:8⟫got⟪k:9⟫ to be kidding me.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Why—⟪k:13⟫for the love of god, ⟪k:14⟫why⟪k:15⟫—"
"⟪k:16⟫am I being made to look back at this part of my life? ⟪k:17⟫The miserable, stupid fucking "
"romantic I once was. ⟪k:18⟫Why am I turning back into the boy I tried so hard to forget?⟪k:19⟫"
"⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫Where did this absurd black smoke come from, and why can’t I get out of it?⟪k:22⟫"
"⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫If it’s that white-haired man who’s doing this to me, ⟪k:25⟫then he’s not an angel or "
"a prophet—⟪k:26⟫he’s the goddamned Devil himself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Giovane”? ⟪k:1⟫La mia ⟪k:2⟫giovane⟪k:3⟫ mente?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Oh, per l’amor di Dio. ⟪k:7⟫"
"Dev’essere uno scherzo...⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Santo cielo, perché...?⟪k:11⟫ ⟪k:12⟫Perché⟪k:13⟫ sono "
"costretto a dover rivivere questa parte della mia vita? ⟪k:14⟫Di quando ero un uomo patetico, "
"sciocco e sentimentale. ⟪k:15⟫Perché sto tornando il ragazzo che ho cercato così duramente di "
"dimenticare?⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫Da dove è sbucato questo assurdo fumo nero, e perché non "
"riesco⟪k:19⟫a venirne fuori?⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫Se è stato quell’uomo dai capelli bianchi a farmi "
"questo, ⟪k:23⟫allora non è né un angelo né un profeta—⟪k:24⟫è il fottuto Diavolo in persona."

#: scenario8:scenario8_786D373C_CF6E_4B10_A7A3_D6A9902D5356
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 291aa84e493fcf69c0a18576866ba7432ffdfaafd6db9e8a43cd89265a60e901
#. default-sha256: 55b7554170e58b97f1028187d49af78705a69eb7ce1e863827cb9721bdfb1369
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_786D373C_CF6E_4B10_A7A3_D6A9902D5356"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫To be blunt, the "
"world’s a small place.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫There’s an unimaginable amount of it out there, but you "
"only ever get to see a minuscule fraction of that. ⟪k:18⟫And that goes doubly so for us—⟪k:19⟫the "
"poor barely get the chance to see any of it at all.⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫And those who were "
"born into affluence, well, they have no idea just how small ⟪k:24⟫our⟪k:25⟫ world really is."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Francamente, "
"penso che questo sia un mondo piccolo.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Certo, si estende a perdita d’occhio là "
"fuori, ma si è in grado di vederne solo una minima parte. ⟪k:18⟫E questo valeva ancora di più per "
"noi—⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫i poveri non sono in grado di vederlo affatto.⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫E coloro "
"che sono nati nella ricchezza, beh, non hanno la più pallida idea di quanto fosse piccolo il "
"⟪k:25⟫nostro⟪k:26⟫ mondo."

#: scenario8:scenario8_EE2C8230_1730_4B5F_AA1D_4638F60D5709
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7a82165e78395cb832ec1ad93604456830de6abc3018ed8ac3802a3c5271183d
#. default-sha256: 573c1e0c150ea995707b2f137788df70fa7af26505cd4bd790993fc0142e0a5a
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_EE2C8230_1730_4B5F_AA1D_4638F60D5709"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫A close friend of mine—a prostitute—said she thought it might be a psychological thing, but "
"regardless, I continued applying the ointment to Morgana’s face.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫“Hey. C’mon, "
"don’t turn away from me.”⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫“............”⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫“I know you can hear me. "
"⟪k:11⟫I brought ointment, so let me put it on you.”⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫“It’s a waste of time.”⟪k:15⟫"
"⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫“You don’t know that. ⟪k:18⟫Your arms look much better than before.⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫It "
"won’t be long before your face starts healing too.”⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫“The ointment isn’t free. "
"⟪k:24⟫You’re wasting your money.”⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫“It’s my money. I can use it however I please. "
"So just shut up and let me do this.”⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫“You’re a very obnoxious man, you "
"know.”⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫“What was that? You want me to rub it in ⟪k:34⟫real hard⟪k:35⟫, "
"huh?”⟪k:36⟫⟪k:37⟫⟪k:38⟫“Fine...”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Ehi... Dai, su, non voltarmi le spalle.”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“............”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫“So che "
"riesci a sentirmi. ⟪k:7⟫Ho comprato dell’altro unguento,⟪k:8⟫lascia che te lo metta.”⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫"
"⟪k:11⟫“⟪k:12⟫È⟪k:13⟫ una perdita di tempo.”⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫“Non puoi saperlo. ⟪k:17⟫Oltretutto, "
"sembra che le tue braccia stiano decisamente meglio di prima.⟪k:18⟫ Non ci vorrà molto prima che "
"anche il tuo viso inizi a guarire.”⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫“L’unguento non è gratuito. ⟪k:22⟫Stai solo "
"sprecando i tuoi soldi.”⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫“Esatto, sono i ⟪k:26⟫miei⟪k:27⟫ soldi, e li uso come "
"mi pare. Perciò sta’ zitta e lasciami fare.”⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫“Sei un uomo davvero "
"insopportabile, lo sai?”⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫“Come hai detto? Vuoi che te lo strofini con forza "
"sulla faccia?”⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫“⟪k:37⟫E va bene⟪k:38⟫...”"

#: scenario8:scenario8_44551E5A_FE36_4981_BA52_B63592A3B670
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a49c5c06d67eb50295f37c0896fa77f9506e9ea5689bfa7471aad7c2009891f1
#. default-sha256: d53c054459cc49d5922c532a0fb4b64548d1ef62becb4e12a779c5d566a87156
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_44551E5A_FE36_4981_BA52_B63592A3B670"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“I hope you’re prepared to be let down, if I ever do heal.”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“That "
"possibility’s just part of the fun.”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫“You have as much tact as a worm.”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫"
"⟪k:9⟫“No tact ⟪k:10⟫and⟪k:11⟫ bad taste. ⟪k:12⟫I’m a real winner.”⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫“It’s a "
"wonder no one throttles you in your sleep.”⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫Being a guy, of course I would "
"have been pleased if she turned out pretty with her face healed, ⟪k:20⟫but her life was "
"guaranteed to be easier than now no matter what she looked like. ⟪k:21⟫That was what really "
"mattered, ultimately. ⟪k:22⟫I could only imagine how hard it was to have your life turned "
"completely upside-down at the age of nine.⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫A large portion of us in the slums "
"had our share of misfortune,⟪k:26⟫but hardly any of them stacked up to what Morgana had had to "
"bear."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Spero che tu sia preparato a rimanere deluso, semmai dovessi guarire.”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫"
"⟪k:3⟫“Questa possibilità fa parte del divertimento.”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫“Hai lo stesso tatto di un "
"verme.”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“Senza tatto e dai pessimi gusti. ⟪k:10⟫Cosa vuoi di più?”⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫"
"⟪k:13⟫“Mi sorprende che nessuno ti abbia ancora strangolato nel sonno.”⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"Essendo un uomo, ovviamente mi avrebbe fatto piacere se si fosse rivelata una bella ragazza, una "
"volta che il suo viso fosse guarito,⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫ma la sua vita sarebbe stata sicuramente più "
"facile, a prescindere da quale sarebbe stato il suo aspetto. ⟪k:20⟫Fondamentalmente, quella era "
"la cosa più importante. ⟪k:21⟫Potevo solo immaginare quanto fosse stato difficile per lei vedere "
"la propria vita completamente sconvolta all’età di nove anni.⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫Gran parte di noi "
"che abitavamo nei bassifondi avevamo la nostra dose di sventure, ma nessuna di queste poteva "
"essere paragonata⟪k:25⟫a quella che Morgana era stata costretta a subire."

#: scenario8:scenario8_47D71963_0C1B_4A04_9238_A6D9D35E9356
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 76117b1f1030ca7e130326b90fd5da93323804b21dd8214169452b59d08b24e2
#. default-sha256: 43ad094a4123f8b66e3851de5cede1ad0f1b147f6596ce3f42c1606006151fcf
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_47D71963_0C1B_4A04_9238_A6D9D35E9356"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“I’ll still be your friend, even if you turn out to be the ugliest girl in the city. ⟪k:1⟫"
"You should be grateful.”⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫“How is it you haven’t managed to chase off everyone in "
"your life yet?”⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫“I act like a decent guy around other people. ⟪k:8⟫Do my best to "
"fit in.”⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫“Then why are you such a dolt around me?”⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫“Just doing "
"my best to fit in.”⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫“So you’re saying this is ⟪k:18⟫my⟪k:19⟫ fault?”⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫"
"⟪k:22⟫“Everyone could use a thorn or two, makes ’em more exciting—⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫you "
"especially.”⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫“............”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Resterò comunque tuo amico, anche se venissi a scoprire che sei⟪k:1⟫la ragazza più brutta "
"della città. ⟪k:2⟫Dovresti essermi grata.”⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫“Come sei riuscito a non far fuggire "
"ancora nessuno nella tua vita?”⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫“Mi comporto da bravo ragazzo insieme alle altre "
"persone.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Faccio del mio meglio per adattarmi.”⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫“Allora perché sei così "
"idiota quando sei con me?”⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫“Faccio solo del mio meglio per adattarmi.”⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫“Dunque stai dicendo che sarebbe ⟪k:20⟫mia⟪k:21⟫ la colpa?”⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫“Uno o "
"due difetti non hanno mai fatto male a nessuno;⟪k:25⟫rende le persone più eccitanti—⟪k:26⟫"
"specialmente te.”⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫“............”"

#: scenario8:scenario8_FDA66FD5_460B_4F50_8145_DA7B8D4EA247
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3f8d7645b4abc2422edad6383fe9a0653cfbdfc7055c1cee09418fa3252a6ebe
#. default-sha256: 3fd246b09825651e31f4913230be284d86b03ddc12579bfe841f4dba52e5ef3c
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_FDA66FD5_460B_4F50_8145_DA7B8D4EA247"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Okay, that should be everything. ⟪k:1⟫Does it sting anywhere?”⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫“Not "
"particularly, no.”⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫“All right. ⟪k:8⟫Oh, also, finish up here and get back to Maria "
"soon.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Unless you’d rather I drag you there.”⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫“Why?”⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫"
"⟪k:16⟫“Seriously? It’s your damned birthday, that’s why.”⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫“...And?”⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫"
"⟪k:22⟫“What do you ⟪k:23⟫think⟪k:24⟫, dimwit?! ⟪k:25⟫She wants to celebrate!”⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫"
"⟪k:28⟫“............”⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫“Get back there soon, okay? I’m planning to drop by "
"too.”⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫⟪k:34⟫“............”⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫⟪k:37⟫⟪k:38⟫“Okay?”⟪k:39⟫⟪k:40⟫⟪k:41⟫"
"⟪k:42⟫“Okay...”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Okay, dovrebbe bastare. ⟪k:1⟫Ti brucia da qualche parte?”⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫“Non "
"particolarmente, no.”⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫“Perfetto. ⟪k:8⟫Ah, vedi di sbrigarti qui, e torna da Maria "
"il prima possibile.⟪k:9⟫ A meno che tu preferisca essere trascinata fin lì.”⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫"
"⟪k:12⟫“Perché?”⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫“E me lo chiedi pure? ⟪k:16⟫Diamine, è il tuo compleanno, ecco "
"perché.”⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫“...E quindi?”⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫“Tu che dici, testa vuota?! ⟪k:23⟫Vuole "
"festeggiare!”⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫“............”⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫“Rientra subito, intesi? Ho in "
"mente di fare un salto anch’io.”⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫“............”⟪k:33⟫⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫“⟪k:36⟫"
"Intesi⟪k:37⟫?”⟪k:38⟫⟪k:39⟫⟪k:40⟫“Intesi...”"

#: scenario8:scenario8_12FD5CC1_0497_4182_B707_99378FD205DC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dff44dab5aa25b4e80472f5a9b676406a04d131a94879edb7766962bf963a9c9
#. default-sha256: da3df8b0bab4a38f3a42c77f76454ab4b4fbe3f40e5a93d2f166d1a77d9b6bdf
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_12FD5CC1_0497_4182_B707_99378FD205DC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“So hey, uh...”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“...I thought you were leaving?”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫“One day, I’ll "
"show you the world.”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“...I won’t get my hopes up.”⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫“⟪k:13⟫"
"Get⟪k:14⟫ your hopes up, dammit,” ⟪k:15⟫I said with a soft chuckle, and then I took my leave."
"⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫I had every intention of making good on that promise, ⟪k:20⟫and I had "
"more than enough reason to believe I could."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Ehi, senti, ehm...”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“...Pensavo che stessi andando.”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫“Un "
"giorno, ti mostrerò il mondo.”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“...Non ci conterò, sappilo.”⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫"
"⟪k:12⟫“⟪k:13⟫Dovresti⟪k:14⟫, invece.”⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫Le sorrisi, e poi me ne andai.⟪k:19⟫"
"⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫Avevo tutte le intenzioni di mantenere quella promessa, ⟪k:23⟫e avevo più di un "
"motivo per credere che ci sarei riuscito."

#: scenario8:scenario8_3E897460_E262_4F70_8E88_EAA7C66318F2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: be45509ba344df9ede51bdeb7f95ff279417b52ac8dc439fed1f1725510a78fb
#. default-sha256: 1ad43935ee06291b67d28840543e1facde8207cb0d5ac7c6e7e443110c9269aa
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_3E897460_E262_4F70_8E88_EAA7C66318F2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫With the help of a slave trader, I infiltrated the lord’s manor. ⟪k:1⟫I’d known slaves "
"weren’t treated well, but seeing it for myself, I thought most of these people would have been "
"happier having been born as a dog or cat and owned by someone who actually had a heart. ⟪k:2⟫It "
"was revolting, a flagrant injustice.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Broadly speaking, there are two types of "
"people who see injustice in the world:⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫The first are those who have everything, who "
"sit unchallenged at the top of the world, looking down on the less fortunate with pity.⟪k:10⟫"
"⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫The second are those with nothing, who wish to overthrow the entire system keeping "
"them down. ⟪k:13⟫It should come as no surprise that I fell in the second camp."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Grazie all’aiuto di un mercante di schiavi, mi infiltrai nella dimora del lord. ⟪k:1⟫Sapevo "
"che gli schiavi non venivano trattati bene, ma vedendoli di persona pensai che gran parte di loro "
"avrebbero preferito essere nati come cani o gatti, e avere come padrone qualcuno che avesse un "
"cuore. ⟪k:2⟫Era rivoltante, un’innegabile ingiustizia.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫In linea di massima, ci "
"sono due categorie di persone che assistono alle ingiustizie del mondo.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫I primi "
"sono coloro che hanno tutto, e che siedono indisturbati in cima al mondo, mentre dall’alto "
"guardano con pietà i meno fortunati.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫I secondi sono coloro che non hanno nulla, "
"e che desiderano rovesciare completamente il sistema che li tiene a cuccia.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Non è una "
"sorpresa il fatto che facessi parte della seconda categoria."

#: scenario8:scenario8_9BC291E3_6970_4E11_A3DF_B4978E3C6180
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f89dcea7c3076e6ea45d478e54cab03c85e1a79d2eeb6beeaa603b182e032abc
#. default-sha256: 1c4abd12e55ec2e1780cef4941730f869af5fe4c2aeae7fb47180d726ad5e8a0
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_9BC291E3_6970_4E11_A3DF_B4978E3C6180"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I had neither the money nor the power to guarantee them a ⟪k:1⟫good⟪k:2⟫ life on the "
"outside, ⟪k:3⟫but that hardly mattered to them. ⟪k:4⟫Everyone was sure that wherever they ended "
"up would be better than staying, and I prayed that would be the case.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫It was "
"during the revolt that I saved Morgana. ⟪k:9⟫I would have sent her off somewhere else like all "
"the other slaves, but she was in so dire a condition when I found her that she could hardly even "
"move on her own. She had been sapped of all her willpower.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫So I brought her to "
"the brothel where a friend of mine worked and asked her to take Morgana in."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non avevo né il denaro né il potere per garantirgli una vita felice,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ma questo per "
"loro contava poco. ⟪k:3⟫Erano certi che in qualunque posto fossero finiti sarebbe stato meglio "
"che rimanere lì, e io pregai affinché fosse così.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Fu durante la rivolta che "
"salvai Morgana. ⟪k:8⟫L’avrei mandata via da qualche parte come tutti gli altri schiavi, ma quando "
"l’avevo trovata⟪k:9⟫era in condizioni così gravi che da sola non sarebbe riuscita neanche a "
"muoversi. Era stata privata di qualsivoglia forza di volontà.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Così la portai al "
"bordello dove lavorava una mia amica, chiedendole di prendere Morgana con sé."

#: scenario8:scenario8_74EA2888_A79D_42A3_82B0_B823D2B2D445
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 72d999042c774528e7f65b52bc53a5444e9ef0474e6b7eb24ac162129501af93
#. default-sha256: 7cf2ae93b9ba43f29a15c985f245bbfc5d7fef581856c2391944210a102e65be
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_74EA2888_A79D_42A3_82B0_B823D2B2D445"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My companions and I reveled in the revolt’s success. ⟪k:1⟫It wasn’t enough of an "
"accomplishment to have any real political implications, but we still felt like heroes. ⟪k:2⟫Drunk "
"on victory, we started talking about going bigger, starting a full-on revolution.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫Once the elation passed, though, we realized there wasn’t much more we ⟪k:7⟫could⟪k:8⟫ do. "
"⟪k:9⟫Even if we did manage to start a large enough uprising to kill the lord, we were only "
"peasants. ⟪k:10⟫Not only did we not know the first thing about ruling, the other counts would "
"never acknowledge our authority anyway. ⟪k:11⟫We’d pretend to be in control until the next in "
"line showed up, and that would be the end of that.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫So we just ended up "
"sitting on our thumbs, no way to do anything about our discontent."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Io e miei compagni gioimmo per il nostro successo. ⟪k:1⟫Non era un risultato sufficiente a "
"provocare ripercussioni sulla politica del paese, ma ci sentivamo comunque degli eroi. ⟪k:2⟫"
"Ubriachi di vittoria, iniziammo⟪k:3⟫a pensare in grande, ad una vera e propria rivoluzione.⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Tuttavia, una volta smaltita la sbornia, ci rendemmo conto che non c’era molto che "
"potessimo fare. ⟪k:8⟫Anche se fossimo riusciti a dare inizio ad una ribellione abbastanza grande "
"da uccidere il lord, eravamo soltanto dei plebei. ⟪k:9⟫Non solo non sapevamo come si governasse "
"un paese, ma gli altri conti non avrebbero riconosciuto la nostra autorità⟪k:10⟫in nessun caso. "
"⟪k:11⟫Avremmo finto di essere al comando fino a che non si sarebbe fatto vivo il diretto "
"successore, e quella sarebbe stata la fine.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫E così rimanemmo a girarci i "
"pollici, senza poter fare nulla per il nostro malcontento."

#: scenario8:scenario8_1A1BD576_09C0_4986_8C40_319702E00365
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a968ee96be32b1509f703ff441178b696760b9ab22ac23135ecc91b9b07084a2
#. default-sha256: 4262c35e23658c05db8f11d5f3851e759c0ed8c6028d3b1189656a953fea26ac
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_1A1BD576_09C0_4986_8C40_319702E00365"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The revelation came completely out of the blue.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫According to her, I had royal "
"blood, and if we could convince the lord of that, I would become royalty. Furthermore, she—as my "
"alleged mother—could return to her old life at the manor.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫The woman urged me "
"to take action—⟪k:8⟫to meet the lord, reveal my lineage, and claim—no, ⟪k:9⟫reclaim⟪k:10⟫ my "
"rightful place at the Barnier house.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫I would no longer be a poor peasant living in the "
"slums. I would have a comfortable life."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La rivelazione arrivò come un fulmine a ciel sereno.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Secondo lei, ero di "
"sangue reale, e se fossimo riusciti a convincere⟪k:4⟫il lord di questo, sarei diventato un "
"nobile. Oltretutto, in quanto mia presunta madre, lei sarebbe potuta tornare alla sua vecchia "
"vita alla tenuta.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫La donna mi incitò ad agire—⟪k:9⟫ad incontrare il lord, "
"rivelando la mia discendenza, e a chiedere—⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫no, a ⟪k:12⟫reclamare⟪k:13⟫ il mio "
"legittimo posto all’interno della famiglia Barnier.⟪k:14⟫ Non sarei stato più un povero cittadino "
"dei bassifondi. Avrei condotto una vita agiata."

#: scenario8:scenario8_E6ED4178_99E0_463E_83AF_15CF0FA076A1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2cb2c716dc59f772bc10bfa5519d7cbcb2eab7b937640e62afe9bcc4335a1b9d
#. default-sha256: 992c0cd0fed7afc17f0d7b5b263f1d7df14a5badd98f40d84c6c2f79536987ba
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E6ED4178_99E0_463E_83AF_15CF0FA076A1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Have you decided what you’re going to give her?”⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫That was the "
"very first thing I heard when I stepped through the back door of the brothel. ⟪k:7⟫Maria—a short, "
"blonde-haired prostitute and good friend of mine—flashed me a devilish smirk."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Hai deciso che regalo le farai?”⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Quella fu la prima cosa che "
"udii non appena attraversai l’entrata secondaria del bordello. ⟪k:7⟫Maria—una prostituta dai "
"capelli corti e biondi e mia cara amica—mi accolse con un ghigno diabolico."

#: scenario8:scenario8_CEC00B65_8D47_4DDF_8848_0962A01CA367
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a5f259ace6458257e269767bcc1005a9e69cb2d0a3429ee8a888b6bd029e1103
#. default-sha256: 971daf595ce12c57b3fc93386ffb2ffc14b15931d342519d800d45ecc89bd6f1
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_CEC00B65_8D47_4DDF_8848_0962A01CA367"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“I bought a necklace, as per your suggestion. ⟪k:1⟫Girls appreciate that sort of thing, "
"don’t they?”⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫“Most do. ⟪k:5⟫Me, I’ve got a taste for knives and other such pointy "
"things. ⟪k:6⟫I doubt she has much interest in those, though.”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“Sometimes, I wonder "
"if you’re actually a girl.”⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Anyone could see that Maria and I were close, "
"but our relationship was strictly platonic. ⟪k:14⟫Of course, given her line of work, it was "
"unavoidable that people thought otherwise."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Le ho comprato un ciondolo, come mi hai suggerito tu.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Alle ragazze piacciono "
"questo genere di cose, no?”⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫“A molte di loro sì. ⟪k:6⟫Io personalmente ho un debole "
"per i coltelli⟪k:7⟫e altri affari appuntiti. ⟪k:8⟫Ma dubito che a lei interessino cose "
"simili.”⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫“A volte mi domando se sei veramente una ragazza.”⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫"
"⟪k:15⟫Chiunque avrebbe notato che Maria ed io eravamo legati, ma il nostro era un rapporto "
"puramente platonico. ⟪k:16⟫Ovviamente, considerata la sua professione, era inevitabile che la "
"gente pensasse il contrario."

#: scenario8:scenario8_BB7592BD_E5CE_4BB4_8016_F5FF4A31A8DB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e2bb0da3a8e75e6d9bc9ba19a209f877614593d7ba378152f629ca2823d2ee45
#. default-sha256: 17c7131424acc3181858fd6ef262d6ace143b0a50f114a7bd2089cae0fa2cd2a
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_BB7592BD_E5CE_4BB4_8016_F5FF4A31A8DB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And honestly, it irritated me every time someone suggested we were anything more than "
"friends. ⟪k:1⟫People have this annoying, shortsighted tendency to assume that just because a guy "
"and a girl are friendly, they must be intimate. ⟪k:2⟫It didn’t matter that she was a girl; I only "
"thought of her as a friend, and as best as I could tell, that’s all she thought of me as well."
"⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Maria and I first met when we were children. ⟪k:7⟫Even at that age, she was "
"already a prostitute—myself a petty thief. ⟪k:8⟫We were both incredibly lucky to have survived to "
"adulthood with only ourselves to watch each others’ backs.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫It’s possible the only "
"reason either of us maintained the willpower to survive this long was because we had each other "
"to bitch about life to when things got bad."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E onestamente, mi irritava ogni volta che qualcuno insinuava che⟪k:1⟫io e lei fossimo più "
"che semplici amici. ⟪k:2⟫Le persone hanno questa ottusa⟪k:3⟫e fastidiosa tendenza a dare per "
"scontato che siccome un maschio e una femmina sono amici, allora devono avere per forza una "
"relazione.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Non aveva importanza che lei fosse una ragazza; per me lei non era altro che "
"un’amica, e per quanto ne sapevo, lei pensava lo stesso di me.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Maria ed io ci "
"siamo conosciuti da ragazzini. ⟪k:10⟫Lei era una prostituta già da piccola, mentre io ero un "
"ladruncolo. ⟪k:11⟫Siamo stati entrambi incredibilmente fortunati a sopravvivere fino all’età "
"adulta da soli, guardandoci le spalle a vicenda.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫È⟪k:16⟫ possibile che "
"l’unica ragione per cui siamo riusciti a non perdere la volontà di sopravvivere tanto a lungo era "
"perché avevamo l’un l’altra per sfogarci, quando le cose andavano male."

#: scenario8:scenario8_398D5BC2_37AD_4D31_86CE_A380A363D7A8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9bd9fb19b348fdb8aba005c45ca6308aa68205812839cf198cd2a3309ca7cb1f
#. default-sha256: 378250eed030ae1c09f83e911f0c57072181d39e780b2ae169264cf375ecf783
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_398D5BC2_37AD_4D31_86CE_A380A363D7A8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I chewed over what Maria had said as I watched her disappear down a brothel corridor. ⟪k:1⟫"
"She wasn’t wrong. She wasn’t overanalyzing.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I did, indeed, have special "
"feelings for Morgana."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Meditai su quanto Maria mi aveva detto, mentre la guardavo dileguarsi lungo il corridoio del "
"bordello. ⟪k:1⟫Non aveva affatto torto.⟪k:2⟫Aveva capito tutto.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Provavo "
"qualcosa di speciale per Morgana."

#: scenario8:scenario8_DFD2E726_2ACA_4628_9B52_B8CFD39C2687
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: febc4c0ba76aac5ab8c61121c5c01316a4f3f9d6ea48c35bc8c978451d3516c0
#. default-sha256: edf2dfdc2938fa5b10db47effdeb14a3910d997c76a986ed977f2d2ffd0a9bcb
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_DFD2E726_2ACA_4628_9B52_B8CFD39C2687"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Any other girl Morgana’s age just looked like another kid to me. ⟪k:1⟫So why was she any "
"different?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫She was covered in scars, and every other time we met, she would tell me "
"to go to Hell, and she refused to walk anywhere with me, and no matter how much ice I broke, I "
"could never seem to get all the way through.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Yet still, the world felt like it was "
"just a little bit better a place when I was with her.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫It made me want to see her "
"smile, no matter how grotesque her face."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ai miei occhi, qualunque altra ragazza della sua stessa età sarebbe apparsa come una bambina "
"qualsiasi. ⟪k:1⟫Dunque lei cos’aveva di tanto diverso?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Era ricoperta da cicatrici, "
"e ogni volta che ci incontravamo mi mandava all’Inferno; si rifiutava di passeggiare insieme a "
"me, e non aveva importanza quante volte provassi a rompere il ghiaccio con lei, non riuscivo a "
"farmi largo nel suo animo.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Eppure, nonostante tutto, il mondo mi sembrava un posto "
"migliore quando ero insieme a lei.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Mi portava a desiderare di vederla sorridere, a "
"prescindere da quanto fosse grottesco il suo volto."

#: scenario8:scenario8_27A0BE22_4D24_451D_9ECE_BCD50CB3BFFB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a2249f402559942fccbcb6faba4623340971af02536e901cf7e08426caee0adb
#. default-sha256: 0b8407821adc6472039f9468cf862e599d6ee84b527cd087210f15fe507c42fd
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_27A0BE22_4D24_451D_9ECE_BCD50CB3BFFB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“You guys think you could maybe... change the subject?”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“Like we have anything "
"⟪k:4⟫else⟪k:5⟫ to talk about.”⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫“Making the birthday girl want to hide in a corner "
"defeats the whole purpose, don’t you think?”⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫“Oh, no, don’t mind me. ⟪k:12⟫I "
"don’t have anything I want to talk about,” ⟪k:13⟫Morgana said almost in a whisper, her head "
"downturned."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Ragazze, non è che per caso potreste... cambiare argomento?”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“Come se "
"avessimo ⟪k:4⟫altro⟪k:5⟫ di cui parlare.”⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫“Portare la festeggiata a nascondersi in "
"un angolo vanifica ogni proposito, non credete?”⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫“Ah, no, non badate a me. ⟪k:12⟫"
"Non ho niente da dire.”⟪k:13⟫—disse Morgana quasi in un sussurro, con la testa rivolta verso il "
"basso."

#: scenario8:scenario8_0A1D16C1_7EF0_4801_8B4B_A1B9B16DC88A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6d87d46f90fdf62a7601f3b6462ae4e4ec8af5c37b97030fb57ded611047cd54
#. default-sha256: 083b181f34f97fc2b546c6c1ae13a539b0c669d5c59ae72020a3446d2d1c09c0
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0A1D16C1_7EF0_4801_8B4B_A1B9B16DC88A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Say, the young man over—”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“Wait! Stop right there! ⟪k:4⟫Don’t say another "
"word!”⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫“Whoopsie. Me and my big mouth. I almost did your job for you...”⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫"
"⟪k:10⟫“G— Dammit, Maria!”⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫This was not good. ⟪k:15⟫Like hell I was going "
"to let her corner me into saying it here.⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫I stole a glance at Morgana, but her "
"gaze was locked on her knees.⟪k:19⟫I couldn’t see what—if any—kind of reaction she was having."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Che ne dici di quel giovanotto—”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“Aspetta! Ferma dove sei! ⟪k:4⟫Non dire "
"un’altra parola!”⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫“Oops. Io e la mia lingua lunga... Per poco non parlavo al posto "
"tuo...”⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫“Ngh— Dannazione, Maria!”⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Non andava affatto bene. "
"⟪k:15⟫Col cavolo che le avrei permesso di mettermi con le spalle al muro.⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫"
"Guardai Morgana di sfuggita, ma il suo sguardo era fisso sulle proprie ginocchia. Non riuscivo a "
"capire che reazione avesse avuto—⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫sempre se ne avesse avuta una."

#: scenario8:scenario8_EEF8DE47_7C47_4EE9_9EF5_BB0CB2812232
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a60ae825b55f5c397c4b87e97b34092e678897811837498cef56fcc6e6d54bf3
#. default-sha256: 0e2bf3a24db7612842596ce3ed7e05583bde9b9bddf10f4decf7ca3fd728cb3f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_EEF8DE47_7C47_4EE9_9EF5_BB0CB2812232"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“I, uh, Morgana... what she was trying to say is...”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“............”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫“Is that I, um, I...”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“...I have to go.”⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫“...What?”⟪k:13⟫"
"⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫“I have to go to the bathroom.”⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫“S-Sure.”⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫"
"Morgana got up from her chair and left the room in silence.⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫I imagine I was making a "
"rather flaccid expression, because as soon⟪k:25⟫as Morgana was gone, Maria began cackling like a "
"madwoman. ⟪k:26⟫My reply was the nearest object, courtesy of my throwing arm."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Ehm, Morgana... quello che lei sta cercando di dire...”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“............”⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫“⟪k:7⟫È⟪k:8⟫ che io, ehm, ecco...”⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫“...Devo andare.”⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫"
"⟪k:14⟫“...Cosa?”⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫“Devo andare al bagno.”⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫“Ah,⟪k:21⟫ v-⟪k:22⟫va "
"bene.”⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫Morgana si alzò e uscì dalla stanza in silenzio.⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫"
"Dovevo avere un’espressione piuttosto buffa, perché non appena Morgana scomparve alla vista, "
"Maria iniziò a ridere come una matta.⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫La mia risposta fu l’oggetto più vicino, "
"gentilmente offerto dal mio braccio."

#: scenario8:scenario8_4ECBE237_62DE_470D_91CF_D30816E25ADF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 857347edb3d84be5fafa8bcf51f0482a23eb58d994599ccfa64eccc3de3c7672
#. default-sha256: 0e0b771e98a88d23044b369dbec0c4042de0e5f2c24e4a1c8b29ee4a718cc526
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4ECBE237_62DE_470D_91CF_D30816E25ADF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Looooser. ⟪k:1⟫How hard is it to just ⟪k:2⟫say it⟪k:3⟫?”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫“It would have been "
"easier if you hadn’t cornered me like that!”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“You think I believe you would’ve done "
"it ⟪k:10⟫without⟪k:11⟫ a little nudge?”⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫“I-I would have. ⟪k:15⟫"
"Eventually...”⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫“Eventually ain’t gonna cut it. ⟪k:19⟫Now⟪k:20⟫’s the right time. "
"⟪k:21⟫And don’t worry, me and the girls won’t make fun of you for getting your rocks off to "
"little girls!”⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫“That’s not the reason I like her! ⟪k:25⟫Besides, I would, um, I "
"would wait at least four years before—”⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫“Doesn’t mean you can’t ⟪k:29⟫tell "
"her⟪k:30⟫ now. ⟪k:31⟫I think it’d do her wonders, really. ⟪k:32⟫She’s, well, you know... ⟪k:33⟫So "
"I think knowing someone cares about her’ll lighten the load a bit.”⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫"
"⟪k:36⟫“............”⟪k:37⟫⟪k:38⟫⟪k:39⟫“When she comes back, give her the necklace and tell her "
"how you feel. ⟪k:40⟫And if she turns you down, we can all have a good laugh about it!”⟪k:41⟫⟪k:42⟫"
"⟪k:43⟫“............”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Sei proprio un cacasotto. ⟪k:1⟫Quanto ti costa ⟪k:2⟫dirlo e basta⟪k:3⟫?”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫“Sarebbe stato più facile se non mi avessi messo alle strette!”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“A chi vuoi "
"darla a bere? Non l’avresti mai fatto senza una piccola spinta.”⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫“L-⟪k:13⟫Lo "
"avrei fatto. ⟪k:14⟫A tempo debito...”⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫“A tempo debito un paio di palle. ⟪k:18⟫"
"È⟪k:19⟫ ⟪k:20⟫questo⟪k:21⟫ il momento giusto.⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫E non preoccuparti, io e le ragazze non "
"ti prenderemo in giro per il fatto che ti piacciono le ragazzine!”⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫“Non è questo "
"il motivo per cui mi piace! ⟪k:27⟫E poi vorrei, ehm...⟪k:28⟫vorrei aspettare almeno quattro anni "
"prima di—”⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫“Questo non significa che tu non possa ⟪k:32⟫dirglielo ora⟪k:33⟫. "
"⟪k:34⟫Penso che le farebbe bene, dico davvero. ⟪k:35⟫Lei è così, beh, lo sai... ⟪k:36⟫Perciò "
"immagino che sapere di avere qualcuno che tiene a lei le renderà la vita più facile.”⟪k:37⟫⟪k:38⟫"
"⟪k:39⟫“............”⟪k:40⟫⟪k:41⟫⟪k:42⟫“Appena torna, dalle il ciondolo e dille ciò che provi. "
"⟪k:43⟫E se ti rifiuterà, potremo farci tutti una bella risata!”⟪k:44⟫⟪k:45⟫⟪k:46⟫“............”"

#: scenario8:scenario8_141DB135_3695_45D1_B53A_EA3757888757
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f01ca8e679243ad3dc99f7e41c2518142426eaca77e676c3725b83aaa91f4542
#. default-sha256: b1babe30e9a2617983c1fa3896c629cdf34b9cfb6e35a3889a981d0d77e9613f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_141DB135_3695_45D1_B53A_EA3757888757"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maria and a few other girls chuckled.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫As uncomfortable as she was making me "
"feel, she had a point. ⟪k:4⟫Regardless of whether Morgana reciprocated my feelings or not, there "
"was a good chance that just putting them out there would help in breaking down the walls she had "
"built in her heart.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫And maybe one day... ⟪k:8⟫I would actually be able to see her "
"smile.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫(I’ll do it. I’ll tell her.)"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maria e le altre ridacchiarono.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Per quanto mi stesse facendo sentire a "
"disagio, non aveva tutti i torti. ⟪k:4⟫Indipendentemente dal fatto che i miei sentimenti fossero "
"corrisposti⟪k:5⟫o meno, era molto probabile che il solo esprimerli avrebbe aiutato⟪k:6⟫ad "
"abbattere le mura che Morgana aveva costruito attorno al proprio cuore.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫E forse un "
"giorno... ⟪k:10⟫sarei stato in grado di vederla sorridere.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫(E va bene. "
"Glielo dirò.)"

#: scenario8:scenario8_7F4368ED_5327_4D09_83CF_8E274FB13B4D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ed46fe7e9f3440748fe98ac9234698dfb726e4d8a9ec71246d83c13f923416ca
#. default-sha256: 17d241e989aeecf4cc1c7a448eeb135a6e5088743d673c7e9a68813a021b8cd6
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_7F4368ED_5327_4D09_83CF_8E274FB13B4D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It didn’t matter if I came out looking like a loser.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫It didn’t matter if "
"Morgana wasn’t interested in me that way.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫What mattered was that she knew someone "
"accepted her, regardless of her appearance or the things she had been through.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫"
"⟪k:10⟫And if, by some chance, there really ⟪k:11⟫was⟪k:12⟫ royal blood flowing through my veins, "
"⟪k:13⟫then I could make good on my promise to show her the world.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫I could put an "
"end to her life of poverty and abuse, ⟪k:17⟫replace it with one of comfort and wealth.⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫"
"⟪k:20⟫I could buy her even better medicine—something that could actually heal her face.⟪k:21⟫"
"⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫If I truly were royalty, I could do so much more for her.⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫"
"(Makes it sound like I want to be some kind of fairy tale hero or something.)"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non aveva importanza se avrei fatto la figura del perdente.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Non aveva "
"importanza se Morgana non sarebbe stata interessata⟪k:4⟫a me allo stesso modo.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"L’importante era farle sapere che qualcuno l’aveva accettata, malgrado il suo aspetto e le cose "
"che aveva passato.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫E se per caso scorreva ⟪k:12⟫davvero⟪k:13⟫ del sangue "
"reale nelle mie vene,⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫allora avrei potuto mantenere la mia promessa—⟪k:16⟫mostrarle il "
"mondo.⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫Avrei potuto porre fine alla sua vita fatta di miseria e soprusi, ⟪k:20⟫"
"rimpiazzandola con una vita fatta di benessere e ricchezza.⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫Avrei potuto persino "
"comprarle medicine migliori—⟪k:24⟫qualcosa che riuscisse davvero a rimarginare il suo viso.⟪k:25⟫"
"⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫Se fossi stato veramente un nobile, avrei potuto fare molto di più⟪k:28⟫per lei.⟪k:29⟫"
"⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫(Lo fa sembrare come se io voglia diventare un eroe delle favole.)"

#: scenario8:scenario8_DC57D65F_CAF4_4145_840D_BDA47478211E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c99911fcc7afee56aab8bfe95d5a3a500951162c86582936a09a3a084d86d986
#. default-sha256: b6fa3b2d44b09f7a31663da7ccb52020f7497df6ab553aa7189c2be375e20dff
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_DC57D65F_CAF4_4145_840D_BDA47478211E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But honestly, ⟪k:1⟫I wouldn’t have minded that.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫If I was going to make her "
"happy, to wipe away all her past misfortune, why couldn’t I make it a little dramatic?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
"⟪k:7⟫It wasn’t usually my style, but in this case, I wouldn’t have objected to a storybook ending."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma onestamente, ⟪k:1⟫non mi sarebbe dispiaciuto.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Se fossi riuscito a renderla "
"felice, e a spazzare via tutte le sue sventure passate, cosa mi avrebbe impedito di essere "
"teatrale?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Di norma non era quello il mio stile, ma in quel caso non mi sarei "
"opposto ad un finale da favola."

#: scenario8:scenario8_4869623B_A83C_49E1_96AA_EEC94BDB18D3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1a34a471d697d14e11e141860acb705f83e20c83bdd5f2457d88737633efbbc8
#. default-sha256: 0b8c8ed227291858a2b6e058881f2c3ee068ff9007a6576a01ef7ba00cba8432
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4869623B_A83C_49E1_96AA_EEC94BDB18D3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The heavy curtains separating the guest rooms had been torn to shreds, ⟪k:3⟫and "
"they were splattered with blood. ⟪k:4⟫A man, apparently caught without enough time to defend "
"himself, lay splayed out naked on a bed, his empty eyes fixed on the ceiling.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫The "
"whole area reeked of blood.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫“............”⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫All I "
"could do was stare stupefied at the carnage."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Le pesanti tende che separavano le stanze degli ospiti erano state ridotte a "
"brandelli, ed erano macchiate di sangue. ⟪k:3⟫Un uomo, che pareva non essere riuscito a "
"difendersi in tempo, era disteso su uno dei letti nudo come un verme, con gli occhi vuoti rivolti "
"al soffitto.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫L’intero posto puzzava di sangue.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫"
"⟪k:10⟫“............”⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Non potevo fare altro che fissare allibito l’esito di "
"quella carneficina."

#: scenario8:scenario8_626B4A6C_5CF2_4A9B_B626_8CBAE17A7094
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5d40a5086c2267d8257972dd4095bdf4ce8e70b12bd430b5c4f3bb311c81a841
#. default-sha256: 1be1d87e18eb19f9d886beb3c3ee9170e06b79a7556e04ee1e6d215f432aafd9
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_626B4A6C_5CF2_4A9B_B626_8CBAE17A7094"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“What the hell... Why... How could this happen...?”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫My dumbfounded "
"muttering went unanswered, though. ⟪k:5⟫The few who were still alive could no better make sense "
"of the incomprehensible massacre than me. ⟪k:6⟫The sudden, arbitrary upheaval of our world. ⟪k:7⟫"
"The inexplicable, inescapable reality."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Cosa diavolo...? Perché... Com’è potuto accadere...?”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Tuttavia, il mio "
"mormorio esterrefatto non trovò alcuna risposta.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫I pochi che erano ancora vivi non "
"riuscivano a trovare alcun senso all’incomprensibile massacro. ⟪k:7⟫All’improvviso ed arbitrario "
"stravolgimento del nostro mondo. ⟪k:8⟫All’assurda, ineluttabile realtà."

#: scenario8:scenario8_8C8E5FB6_79F8_453D_84FF_F14001C4B3A1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 242fba6358dcb6a28f52aaa3093931c62e30ea2d200a168d8f31f7aff011e77e
#. default-sha256: bf7039fcc71ed9539866f313018fa5b776e7b6075a9fbb72cb6ca15a644c0ad6
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_8C8E5FB6_79F8_453D_84FF_F14001C4B3A1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But I—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I was just—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫I was a mere boy.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫A weak boy, "
"helpless against a few robbers.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫A useless boy, unable to protect anyone."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma io—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫ero soltanto—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫un ragazzo.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Un ragazzo "
"debole, inerme persino contro qualche brigante.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Un ragazzo inutile, incapace di "
"proteggere chiunque."

#: scenario8:scenario8_430AAFCC_A113_4546_B463_3D6B3028FAB2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bed8b7fb0e25c5ea3d93e9f05a49ad214234087560fc46be7777daaf147c4cdd
#. default-sha256: 8b075b07df324945e502eadcbc88deacd565b9b0958d14e38efacc9d540da414
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_430AAFCC_A113_4546_B463_3D6B3028FAB2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The brothel lay in ruins, a bloody pile of torn bedding, clothes, and bodies.⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I made my way back to the front... ⟪k:6⟫and all I could do was stare stupefied at the "
"carnage.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫“What the hell... Why... How could this happen...?”⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫"
"⟪k:14⟫My dumbfounded muttering went unanswered, though.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Maria stood beside me, "
"quietly rubbing her trembling arms."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Il bordello giaceva in rovina—⟪k:3⟫una pila insanguinata di lenzuola strappate, "
"vestiti lacerati, e corpi straziati.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Mi feci strada fino all’entrata... ⟪k:7⟫Non "
"potevo fare altro che fissare allibito l’esito di quella carneficina.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫“Cosa "
"diavolo...? Perché... Com’è potuto accadere...?”⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫Tuttavia, il mio mormorio "
"esterrefatto non trovò alcuna risposta.⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫Maria era in piedi a fianco a me, con le "
"braccia tremanti."

#: scenario8:scenario8_F22EF175_3EA6_4DE8_9A14_F951CFE0F7D1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 14c983b45765323c232249d0413884d8ada5a825767288ce8fef236bcbf7e288
#. default-sha256: 4374d9941e6666213ac8d091743e06bfbe80241f4a110cad89ab371ca6ca9c32
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F22EF175_3EA6_4DE8_9A14_F951CFE0F7D1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Where’s Morgana...?”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“I couldn’t find her...”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫“Why not...?”⟪k:7⟫"
"⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“I’m sorry... I looked everywhere... ⟪k:10⟫but I couldn’t find her... I’m so "
"sorry...”⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫“............”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Dov’è Morgana...?”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“Non sono riuscita a trovarla...”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫“Perché "
"no...?”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“Mi dispiace... Ho cercato ovunque... ma non si trova...⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Mi "
"dispiace tanto...”⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫“............”"

#: scenario8:scenario8_EF31B186_922E_4CFE_96DD_FEF4FA3386DD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 61d24e123ef8294ed654941b0d6b4eace7d9aad1951baac993580c99f87dc558
#. default-sha256: 726087bac53ec3a757cd8f818cef1e190c955a2407f3e222f739393d8bdd2cb8
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_EF31B186_922E_4CFE_96DD_FEF4FA3386DD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I wanted to say I wasn’t blaming her, but I couldn’t find the words.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫If I’d "
"had power... I could have prevented this from happening.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫What ⟪k:7⟫kind⟪k:8⟫ of "
"power would I have needed, though? ⟪k:9⟫The physical strength to overpower the thieves? ⟪k:10⟫"
"No... I needed to think bigger...⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫If I weren’t a peasant, but someone of real "
"influence and import,⟪k:14⟫no one would dare stand up to me. ⟪k:15⟫No petty thieves would ever "
"even consider a raid on me.⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫And I would have the power to punish anyone who "
"tried.⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫But regardless, ⟪k:22⟫this⟪k:23⟫ would have never happened at all."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Volevo dirle che non era colpa sua, ma non riuscivo a trovare⟪k:1⟫le parole.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"Se avessi avuto il potere... avrei potuto impedire che tutto ciò accadesse.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Ma di "
"⟪k:8⟫quale⟪k:9⟫ potere avevo bisogno? ⟪k:10⟫La forza fisica per sgominare i ladri? ⟪k:11⟫No... "
"dovevo pensare in grande...⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Se non fossi stato un plebeo, bensì qualcuno con una "
"reale influenza,⟪k:15⟫nessuno avrebbe osato opporsi a me. ⟪k:16⟫Nessun ladruncolo avrebbe mai "
"preso in considerazione l’idea di invadere il mio territorio.⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫E io avrei avuto "
"il potere di punire chiunque ci avesse provato.⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫Ma in ogni caso, tutto questo "
"non sarebbe mai potuto accadere."

#: scenario8:scenario8_4E6DC835_A99F_4C93_B525_678AD8A2C449
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2ac7edf710a09a1ad83d8cd0dccf725adb71853a832380ccbe47dbaf86f9974e
#. default-sha256: d29c594e249ee1c62f068301fb91d7c49d3adcd9ec3ba0b6c2cfe3d7e9ba7da5
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4E6DC835_A99F_4C93_B525_678AD8A2C449"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was supposed to give Morgana a good life.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫To show her the world.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫To make her smile."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Avrei dovuto garantire a Morgana una vita serena.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Avrei dovuto mostrarle il "
"mondo.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Avrei dovuto farla sorridere."

#: scenario8:scenario8_79B56931_EAE2_4A55_A958_F20784A14276
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 21e76ae19b19af14ff76ea12bfa6e2371578d431d485f872e3b9fb3ba58baeb6
#. default-sha256: 01f0e0b588b934d54b27d446a74206d14f15a323129ae5d0995d6b05a7bd1031
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_79B56931_EAE2_4A55_A958_F20784A14276"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“If you had gone to speak with the lord and revealed your lineage when I first came to see "
"you, you would never have been in that kind of danger.”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“............”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫“There is still time. Go to the lord’s manor, show him—”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“I’m not really your "
"son, am I?”⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫The woman fell silent for a moment, observing me.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫"
"⟪k:16⟫I could see the resemblance between us, yes, ⟪k:17⟫and I had no memories of my mother. "
"⟪k:18⟫It would be nice if she ⟪k:19⟫were⟪k:20⟫ to show back up someday, ⟪k:21⟫but it just wasn’t "
"likely.⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫This whole thing felt extremely contrived."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Se fossi andato a parlare con il lord e avessi svelato la tua discendenza fin dall’inizio, "
"non avresti mai corso questo pericolo.”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“............”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫“C’è ancora "
"tempo. Raggiungi la tenuta del lord, e mostragli—”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“Non sono davvero tuo figlio, è "
"così?”⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Per un attimo la donna smise di parlare, continuando a guardarmi."
"⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫Riuscivo a notare una certa somiglianza tra noi due, certo, ⟪k:17⟫e io non "
"avevo ricordi di mia madre. ⟪k:18⟫Sarebbe bello se un giorno si facesse viva, ⟪k:19⟫ma non era "
"quello il caso.⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫L’intera faccenda sembrava estremamente forzata."

#: scenario8:scenario8_1A18C552_6D1C_4937_8FD4_F94F56BFC5EA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 45b1dfe1a05cd67a52ebde5b5da37b816bb2562a95426fa9863e987386c8a35b
#. default-sha256: 960161247f1798fb23eda73966b69b282bff5bb441e1d66cd774538f5dafa0d3
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_1A18C552_6D1C_4937_8FD4_F94F56BFC5EA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Discussions will progress much smoother if we both know what the other wants out of this "
"arrangement. ⟪k:1⟫Start by telling me who you really are. ⟪k:2⟫Were you actually a maidservant "
"for the previous lord?”⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫She gave a nod, then walked over to a grimy shelf and "
"retrieved a ring that looked very much out of place. ⟪k:7⟫It was made of gold, engraved with an "
"elaborate insignia."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Sarà molto più facile discutere se sapessimo entrambi ciò che l’altro vuole ottenere da "
"questo accordo. ⟪k:1⟫Inizia col dirmi chi sei veramente.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Sei stata davvero una "
"servitrice del precedente lord?”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Lei annuì, poi si avvicinò ad uno scaffale "
"sporco e tirò fuori un anello che sembrava del tutto fuori posto. ⟪k:8⟫Era d’oro, e vi era inciso "
"un emblema molto elaborato."

#: scenario8:scenario8_B894E5C6_9F05_4669_B349_D516FA0F9071
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 873fcb679252fb0977e09e3fe7e25327c293bb8f3bce50d89b2275a7d3ebfca0
#. default-sha256: f1f927e516a80778dcb20784ad2a0eb941249a2aae7252e9cc351bdad92b2c65
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B894E5C6_9F05_4669_B349_D516FA0F9071"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“But, being a woman, you have no means to accomplish that yourself. ⟪k:1⟫So you came up with "
"the idea of using a fake son. ⟪k:2⟫If your child were still alive, he would be right about my "
"age, wouldn’t he? ⟪k:3⟫And we look similar enough for you to convincingly claim we’re "
"related.”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫“............”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“But the biggest reason you chose me... is "
"because I’ve made something of a name for myself. ⟪k:10⟫Because I was one of the people involved "
"in inciting the revolt three years ago. ⟪k:11⟫The perfect choice to spearhead a revolution. ⟪k:12⟫"
"How dramatic, the man who set the lord’s slaves free was secretly his family. ⟪k:13⟫The people "
"would eat it right up.”⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫“............”⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫“So, how far off am I?”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Però, essendo una donna, non hai i mezzi per riuscirci da sola.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Così hai pensato "
"di usare un figlio fasullo. ⟪k:3⟫Se tuo figlio fosse ancora vivo, avrebbe circa la mia età, "
"giusto? ⟪k:4⟫E ci assomigliamo abbastanza da poterli convincere che siamo imparentati.”⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
"⟪k:7⟫“............”⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫“Ma il motivo principale per cui hai scelto me... è perché mi "
"sono fatto un nome. ⟪k:11⟫Perché sono uno di quelli che hanno istigato la rivolta⟪k:12⟫di tre "
"anni fa. ⟪k:13⟫La scelta perfetta per capeggiare una rivoluzione.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫Che storia "
"straordinaria: l’uomo che aveva liberato gli schiavi del lord,⟪k:16⟫in realtà faceva parte della "
"sua stessa famiglia. ⟪k:17⟫La gente prenderebbe un racconto del genere per oro colato.”⟪k:18⟫"
"⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫“............”⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫“Allora, ci sono andato vicino?”"

#: scenario8:scenario8_540A0F67_20C3_4916_A9CB_254ABB24CF48
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e01abc8b66cb2d74b333b606f3efeeed9dd94f0df9733147dfe7d861c8b0dfa0
#. default-sha256: 88d9fd7612cf529f26956b5d9c6509106b008baa7e4641b49b92fcf0d010ca2b
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_540A0F67_20C3_4916_A9CB_254ABB24CF48"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫For some time, the woman sat in silence. ⟪k:1⟫Eventually, she broke it—not by yelling in "
"anger or desperately trying to refute me—but with a smile.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I knew very well what "
"lurked behind that smile too—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫scorn.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫“You’re sharp for a "
"filthy peasant. ⟪k:12⟫It would seem I chose wisely.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La donna non parlò per diverso tempo. ⟪k:1⟫Infine, ruppe il silenzio—⟪k:2⟫ma non urlando "
"dalla rabbia o cercando disperatamente di smentirmi—bensì sorridendo.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫E sapevo "
"benissimo cosa si nascondeva dietro quel sorriso—⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫disprezzo.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫"
"⟪k:12⟫“Sei davvero perspicace per essere un lurido plebeo. ⟪k:13⟫Sembra che io abbia scelto "
"sapientemente.”"

#: scenario8:scenario8_E915B598_C4F6_457A_BBE9_2A48B6DE830E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 14d839a6a489d94e8a14433606085f0a9d0aeaa64e3ce7f214bd7a92e3da75cb
#. default-sha256: fcca78a810a5579237968141634da83e14a618bfb0650c408cbb0b531bfdfdfc
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E915B598_C4F6_457A_BBE9_2A48B6DE830E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was right. She was a manipulative, conniving shyster. ⟪k:1⟫But that—⟪k:2⟫that⟪k:3⟫ I could "
"work with. That fit so much better.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫I wasn’t royalty. I wasn’t a hero.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫"
"⟪k:9⟫I was a filthy peasant.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫“I’m in.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Avevo ragione. Era un’infida manipolatrice.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Ma ⟪k:4⟫così⟪k:5⟫ aveva molto più "
"senso.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Non ero un nobile. Non ero un eroe.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Ero un lurido plebeo."
"⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫“Ci sto.”"

#: scenario8:scenario8_6FB662B3_DB0A_4CC6_A107_7424922341D1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b1105c7dd264fcc88ef7a1625cda47fe16e22457fa57ba8def0f29023df8d7f0
#. default-sha256: 09b7571a2b54d8cef7bbbaf666cc7d77c6d6e32afda1e4917ddce9d1571887eb
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_6FB662B3_DB0A_4CC6_A107_7424922341D1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The first thing I did after agreeing to work with the woman was not to approach "
"the lord, but to reveal my false lineage to my accomplices. ⟪k:3⟫They all thought I was joking—"
"until I showed them the ring. ⟪k:4⟫Then, their dreams of revolution started seeming far more "
"realistic.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Maria was the one exception. ⟪k:9⟫Not only did she not believe me, "
"she tried to stop me from going through with the scheme."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫La prima cosa che feci dopo aver accettato di lavorare con la donna non fu "
"avvicinarmi al lord, ma rivelare la mia falsa discendenza ai miei complici. ⟪k:3⟫Pensavano tutti "
"che stessi scherzando—finché non mostrai loro l’anello. ⟪k:4⟫A quel punto, il loro sogno di dare "
"inizio a una rivoluzione cominciò a sembrare molto più concreto.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Maria era "
"l’unica eccezione. ⟪k:9⟫Non solo non mi credette, provò a impedirmi di andare fino in fondo con "
"quel piano."

#: scenario8:scenario8_BE0A3793_8490_4606_BD02_42D44E6EEC78
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 02c9e5c98888bb2baca1d57d9fec462dd851ab17e0ebf650a275af91426d77d2
#. default-sha256: acbc4223354460bb7f4a338dc184d78c0c61aa1506b4c13f133f3a21f1961153
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_BE0A3793_8490_4606_BD02_42D44E6EEC78"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Hear me, my fellow citizens,⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫who live in suffering at the hands of "
"your supposed “lord”!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Ascoltatemi, miei cari concittadini,⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫che vivete soffrendo per mano "
"del vostro presunto “lord”!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_27AC972C_A7F4_4E25_9EA1_F19A4A331E17
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fdd8037b60569323e819edef95ee8231328b1c07918dd86cb4b4947b989e5dc5
