msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_2E462F1F_81D0_44A6_BF68_3DAB8B6DEC97"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫All of you, stand with me!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Tutti voi, unitevi a me!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_E84C3D78_872E_4233_8273_D488507603B9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6e9fad1d49365e3c00d4d772016d345e62a4394bee083c3b9d9632de9d3a4ce2
#. default-sha256: 50e7f584b1b412d61c4497fd6e234d571f637c8825f13187d1a56c6c2cb6755f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E84C3D78_872E_4233_8273_D488507603B9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫My call to arms stoked the flames in the people’s hearts.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫When the "
"assault on the lord’s manor began, they were an inferno of righteous justice. ⟪k:6⟫No one was "
"thinking straight.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫I was about the only one with something resembling a clear head "
"amidst the chaos.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫If I were really a hero, ⟪k:13⟫then I would have rejoiced in "
"that glorious day, that momentous turning point in the city’s history. ⟪k:14⟫I would have been "
"honored to have led the charge.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫But this was all about one woman’s avarice and "
"desire for vengeance.⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫This was all about one man’s lamentation of his own "
"weakness.⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫I wasn’t motivated by any desire to help these people."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫La mia chiamata alle armi alimentò la fiamma nel cuore delle persone.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫Quando l’assalto alla tenuta del lord cominciò, il popolo si trasformò in un’ondata di fuoco "
"che reclamava giustizia. ⟪k:6⟫Nessuno pensava in maniera lucida.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Io ero l’unico ad "
"avere le idee chiare nel bel mezzo del caos.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Se fossi stato un vero eroe, ⟪k:13⟫"
"avrei esultato durante quella gloriosa giornata—⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫quel memorabile punto di svolta nella "
"storia della nostra città. ⟪k:16⟫E sarei stato onorato di guidare l’assalto.⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫Ma "
"tutto era partito dall’avidità di una donna e dal suo desiderio⟪k:20⟫di vendetta—⟪k:21⟫e dai "
"lamenti di un uomo per la propria debolezza.⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫Non ero mosso da alcun desiderio di "
"aiutare quelle persone."

#: scenario8:scenario8_8BD360AE_9B1D_4CD0_9703_57280E93CC11
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ce75759702e31b1b1f18f77f8961fde101fc4f92aed3be37caabee43cbdd2895
#. default-sha256: b465747d1a05ce575f42be1fdb9992e83dd58c2f8ab67d6d80763a4462d28381
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_8BD360AE_9B1D_4CD0_9703_57280E93CC11"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The king and the other counts acknowledged my royalty—⟪k:3⟫though it was less "
"because I had the Barniers’ ring and more because they thought that was the best way to prevent "
"things from getting any messier.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫So with their approval, I formally became the lord "
"of the land.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫I also assumed the former lord’s name, because despite his reputation "
"with his people, it was a name people knew, and one that held far more clout than my own.⟪k:10⟫"
"⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫And just like that... ⟪k:14⟫my longtime dream of power had come true."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Il re e gli altri conti riconobbero la mia appartenenza alla famiglia reale—⟪k:3⟫"
"non tanto per il fatto che avessi l’anello dei Barnier, quanto piuttosto perché pensavano che "
"fosse il modo migliore per impedire alla situazione di complicarsi ulteriormente.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫E "
"così, grazie alla loro approvazione, diventai ufficialmente il lord del paese.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫"
"Inoltre, assunsi il nome del precedente lord, perché nonostante la reputazione che aveva tra i "
"suoi abitanti, era un nome che la gente conosceva, e che aveva molta più influenza del mio.⟪k:10⟫"
"⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫E fu così... ⟪k:14⟫che ottenni il potere che tanto avevo sognato di avere."

#: scenario8:scenario8_474C1A37_B768_48C8_AC64_7E2D9225CDFD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 54bf6544299034e3dd02b8fd83912bdde9f34d5592d2d6991d7fd858b64439c3
#. default-sha256: 8a829bc3f38c02a639308ad9cdbd78bce7222f062ee9a66e956cf77b7dbd2e8e
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_474C1A37_B768_48C8_AC64_7E2D9225CDFD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫That said, simply ⟪k:3⟫becoming⟪k:4⟫ the lord didn’t mean everything had fallen "
"neatly into place.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Many of the local noble families accused me of acquiring my rank "
"illegitimately. ⟪k:8⟫They waited, fangs bared, for me to slip up. ⟪k:9⟫They even tried to set me "
"up on more than one occasion.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫I couldn’t trust anyone.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫On top "
"of that, if I took too long making the improvements I had promised the people, they would start "
"saying I was just as much of a tyrant as the previous lord. ⟪k:16⟫There was only so much I could "
"do at once, though, especially with my hands so full fending off the vulturous nobles.⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫"
"⟪k:19⟫Exhaustion soon began to set in."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Detto ciò, il fatto di essere diventato lord non significava che ogni cosa si "
"fosse sistemata.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Molte famiglie nobili del paese mi accusarono di aver ottenuto la "
"mia posizione illecitamente. ⟪k:6⟫Rimanevano in attesa, con le zanne scoperte, pronte a "
"scagliarsi al mio primo passo falso. ⟪k:7⟫Tentarono addirittura di incastrarmi, in più di "
"un’occasione.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Non potevo fidarmi di nessuno.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Oltretutto, se ci "
"avessi messo troppo tempo ad apportare i miglioramenti che avevo promesso al popolo, avrebbero "
"iniziato a dire che non ero tanto diverso dal lord precedente. ⟪k:14⟫Ma non mi era possibile fare "
"tutto allo stesso tempo, specialmente se ero impegnato a respingere quei nobili avvoltoi.⟪k:15⟫"
"⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Ben presto, l’esaurimento nervoso iniziò a stremarmi."

#: scenario8:scenario8_33EF9F7F_CD08_45A5_AAF4_D2248F54852F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6de2fbb7e3f7604d9a47914d05bdfe565b276eb188ce8b7af5403d0dc72daec8
#. default-sha256: e893a5090d3c981f6c2f054e773af37a38cf6219bf3a4f8a66b5a457d22a47ef
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_33EF9F7F_CD08_45A5_AAF4_D2248F54852F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫This wasn’t the world I was looking for—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫the one I wanted to show Morgana."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non era quello il mondo che volevo—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫il mondo che desideravo mostrare a Morgana."

#: scenario8:scenario8_BFEFE85D_3A2B_4E79_A439_2A3027A5BDE6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f76d6adffd92128bdee369bf6caf137c8a267ab907e3df079c100d0ef42f734e
#. default-sha256: bc8c6c1a28462cb5a0840d6fa9d933c526b3a82f12c862eae75648d4f73c8d13
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_BFEFE85D_3A2B_4E79_A439_2A3027A5BDE6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫It was day after draining day of betrayal, constantly having to look "
"over my shoulder, fighting to meet unrealistic expectations. I was starting to lose sight of who "
"I was as a person.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫I couldn’t let anyone see me looking weak. They would see it as "
"an opportunity to take advantage of me. ⟪k:8⟫To manipulate me. ⟪k:9⟫To eliminate me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Era un continuo susseguirsi di tradimenti; dovevo guardarmi le spalle "
"costantemente, e lottare pur di soddisfare delle aspettative irrealizzabili. Stavo cominciando a "
"perdere di vista la persona che ero.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Non potevo apparire debole agli occhi di "
"nessuno. L’avrebbero vista come un’occasione per sfruttarmi. ⟪k:8⟫Per manipolarmi. ⟪k:9⟫Per "
"eliminarmi."

#: scenario8:scenario8_102B7478_EF5F_4DC9_B2F4_B8A1DEB59125
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eec1094cad4715a781d522533337ca280a018fbd545f6d632b53e2cd446bc439
#. default-sha256: 359b7807096eebd8d825b59ef102c894e55daaff977584d4bdc28ce09c1b3096
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_102B7478_EF5F_4DC9_B2F4_B8A1DEB59125"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I needed power to protect myself from those people.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Attaining rank was only "
"the first step. ⟪k:4⟫I needed even ⟪k:5⟫more⟪k:6⟫ power. ⟪k:7⟫Enough to ensure no one would ever "
"be giving me orders, could ever play me for a fool."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mi serviva il potere per proteggermi da quelle persone.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Ottenere quel rango "
"era solo il primo passo. ⟪k:4⟫Avevo bisogno di ⟪k:5⟫più⟪k:6⟫ potere. ⟪k:7⟫Abbastanza da "
"assicurarmi che nessuno potesse mai darmi ordini—⟪k:8⟫che nessuno potesse mai prendermi per "
"sciocco."

#: scenario8:scenario8_CCDD3038_63D8_4933_B381_8C06536D9476
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 543cc5b2c8606cfad14bfbb5a76a3c5c204f667274c01eaafdffa3a52fe8ec81
#. default-sha256: 66dc6edc9d6965536999c92e7cb808e716ca13043c5c0b6784221ea5702d5f50
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_CCDD3038_63D8_4933_B381_8C06536D9476"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But no one saw what I was doing.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫No one believed me, even when I tried to "
"explain.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫In one case, I invited an old companion to my manor to discuss "
"matters, ⟪k:8⟫but the meeting only turned into an attempt on my life."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma nessuno faceva caso a quello che stavo facendo.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Nessuno mi credeva, anche "
"quando provavo a spiegarmi.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Un giorno, accolsi un mio vecchio compagno alla "
"mia tenuta per discutere di alcune cose, ⟪k:8⟫ma l’incontro si trasformò in un attentato alla mia "
"vita."

#: scenario8:scenario8_61DEBAA5_0DF3_4A89_AA0B_B639C6EBA564
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 376b1f0af216a0ff64427c1e8ab92fa1e4607db97a86341ec5fd992d2eeb5482
#. default-sha256: 0704390d4e9d1b43b68e80c063f7cc54f9b489c00c5c828aff14894222b925e5
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_61DEBAA5_0DF3_4A89_AA0B_B639C6EBA564"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Somewhere along the line, I had lost sight of my original dream. ⟪k:1⟫Lost all my desire to "
"do right by the people I cared about.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Hell—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫I didn’t ⟪k:8⟫have⟪k:9⟫ "
"anyone to do right by anymore."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Da qualche parte lungo la via, persi di vista il mio sogno originale. ⟪k:1⟫Persi ogni "
"volontà di fare del bene alle persone a cui tenevo.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Diamine—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫non avevo più "
"⟪k:7⟫nessuno⟪k:8⟫ a cui fare del bene."

#: scenario8:scenario8_0097DE2D_CB92_44F5_8520_ECAD2B3F07D2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a5abede1ffbf55bef380d5271d51f77de160cc0bc7f62ab77026be7b89c92b5c
#. default-sha256: 18cc519581bd2b6aabde292cab6d57d3e694be67ef84608c3d5e1b530ed059bf
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0097DE2D_CB92_44F5_8520_ECAD2B3F07D2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Why did I need to climb to the top of the ladder?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫So "
"no one could kill me.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Why did I want money?⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫So no one could mock me.⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫Why did I want power?⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫"
"⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫So no one could oppose me.⟪k:29⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Perché avevo bisogno di scalare la vetta?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Perché "
"nessuno potesse uccidermi.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Perché desideravo il denaro?⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫"
"⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫Perché nessuno potesse deridermi.⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫Perché desideravo il "
"potere?⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫Perché nessuno potesse opporsi a me.⟪k:29⟫"

#: scenario8:scenario8_F3EA9C43_9E64_44E7_B13D_A58734A9AC24
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0564649e1833af8ff44e867ad353f0b712c1e55273e66b63db1ae8ea55ff6409
#. default-sha256: 29113c2a1c8fe29f87160ba5e4c03904b3dec65acfdb3c96aba653dcc25b93e3
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F3EA9C43_9E64_44E7_B13D_A58734A9AC24"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Miracle blood? Sounds like a sham to me.”⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫“You never know. ⟪k:6⟫"
"They say the sound of her first cry brought rain to the land where she was born, saving the whole "
"village from drought. ⟪k:7⟫And they say her blood has the power to cure any disease.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Sangue miracoloso? Mi sembra una farsa.”⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫“Non si può mai sapere. "
"⟪k:6⟫Dicono che il suo primo vagito abbia fatto piovere sulla terra in cui era nata, salvando "
"l’intero villaggio dalla siccità.”"

#: scenario8:scenario8_6237928B_76FA_4996_8538_32D565E06097
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2f820f474758679172c276fec0e18ff9808e56d98997fd1ff8bf640c46d13edf
#. default-sha256: 1e370bd747c330d5afbe1258be512993655936c948429ae9b8787900299e1c04
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_6237928B_76FA_4996_8538_32D565E06097"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The people loved their stories of heroes and miracles, ⟪k:1⟫and if I could show some support "
"for the churches, then maybe people would stop complaining I was focusing too much on the economy."
"⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫So I devised a plot to capture the witch and make use of her “miracle blood.” ⟪k:5⟫"
"I would establish a new church, have it be run by a nun the city had been fawning over for some "
"time—they called her “the Saintess.” ⟪k:6⟫There, I would take the witch’s blood and call it a "
"miracle medicine, distributing it in exchange for tithes, which the people would certainly come "
"for in droves. ⟪k:7⟫And if the blood somehow ⟪k:8⟫did⟪k:9⟫ happen to have special powers, then "
"that would make the scheme that much more effective."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il popolo amava le storie sugli eroi e sui miracoli, ⟪k:1⟫e se avessi fornito il mio "
"supporto alla Chiesa, forse la gente avrebbe smesso di lamentarsi del fatto che mi stavo "
"concentrando troppo sull’economia.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Così ideai un piano per catturare la strega e "
"fare uso del suo “sangue miracoloso”. ⟪k:5⟫Avrei stabilito una nuova chiesa, a capo della quale "
"avrei messo una suora che gli abitanti della città lodavano da diverso tempo—⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫la "
"chiamavano “la Santa”. ⟪k:8⟫Poi, avrei preso il sangue dalla strega e lo avrei spacciato per una "
"medicina miracolosa, distribuendola in cambio di decime; le persone sarebbero di certo accorse in "
"massa. ⟪k:9⟫E se per qualche motivo il sangue avesse avuto ⟪k:10⟫davvero⟪k:11⟫ poteri speciali, "
"allora questo avrebbe reso il mio piano ancora più efficace."

#: scenario8:scenario8_2B4B117D_5E12_4E2C_A09D_BE44913A6A03
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b987c171b1ae7e0c466bae5ec058407c3d1c44bbc70e208fd67bda9ed91b1a6a
#. default-sha256: f36e7a9fd67220348d618a940ed9a36822df8319e95d5527734462f323f7bbc8
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_2B4B117D_5E12_4E2C_A09D_BE44913A6A03"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“I’ll worry about the veracity of the rumors later. ⟪k:1⟫Right now, all I want is for you to "
"capture her and bring her to me.”⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫“............”⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫I was too busy "
"to handle capturing the witch myself, ⟪k:9⟫so I went and found someone to handle it for me. ⟪k:10⟫"
"He was a former slave who had, several years back, massacred an entire carriage of slaves and the "
"slave traders transporting them. ⟪k:11⟫Obviously not an upstanding citizen, but there was little "
"doubt he would have any trouble apprehending a single witch.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫The biggest reason "
"I chose him, though, was because he was enamored with the nun.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫I honestly "
"thought it was rather hilarious—a murderer falling in love with a nun."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Penserò alla veridicità delle voci più in là. ⟪k:1⟫Per ora, tutto ciò che voglio è che tu "
"la catturi e che la porti da me.”⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫“............”⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Ero troppo "
"impegnato per poter catturare la strega io stesso, così trovai qualcuno che se ne occupasse per "
"conto mio. ⟪k:9⟫Era un ex schiavo che diversi anni prima aveva massacrato un intero carro di "
"schiavi, compresi i trafficanti che li trasportavano. ⟪k:10⟫Non era di certo un cittadino "
"modello, ma non c’erano dubbi che sarebbe riuscito ad acciuffare una strega senza problemi.⟪k:11⟫"
"⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Il motivo principale per cui scelsi lui, tuttavia, fu perché era innamorato della "
"suora.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫Lo trovavo esilarante—⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫un omicida che si innamora di una suora."

#: scenario8:scenario8_68B6D56C_FA93_482D_93C1_6351A59C71CB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3bcb804488d0352c33914b910349233f74b0ad3ea1909519ea6a6b9ef3979d9b
#. default-sha256: 6ef8e5a2c816e7515621fd9b38542eccd00532eb7d529281c31df2e27c0fd552
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_68B6D56C_FA93_482D_93C1_6351A59C71CB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I thought, with what little remained of my conscience, that I was doing the right thing. "
"⟪k:1⟫If one witch—probably an old woman, at that—was all it cost to accomplish such good, then a "
"worthy sacrifice it was.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫In an ideal world, it wouldn’t matter young or old—a human "
"being was an unacceptable price for anything. ⟪k:5⟫But this was far from an ideal world, ⟪k:6⟫so "
"I decided that taking what little remained of this woman’s life was the best—no, the ⟪k:7⟫"
"only⟪k:8⟫ acceptable course of action.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫She would probably despise me for "
"it, ⟪k:13⟫but I would gladly accept her hatred in exchange for the benefits her blood would bring "
"the city."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Pensavo—con quel poco di coscienza che mi era rimasta—che quella fosse una buona azione. "
"⟪k:1⟫Se una strega—⟪k:2⟫probabilmente una donna anziana, tra l’altro—⟪k:3⟫era l’unico costo "
"necessario per riuscirci, allora sarebbe stato un sacrificio utile.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫In un mondo "
"ideale, un essere umano sarebbe stato un prezzo inaccettabile per qualsiasi cosa, che fosse stato "
"giovane o anziano.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Ma questo è tutt’altro che un mondo ideale, ⟪k:9⟫perciò decisi che "
"togliere a quella donna quel poco che le rimaneva fosse la cosa migliore da fare—⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫"
"anzi, ⟪k:12⟫l’unica⟪k:13⟫ cosa da fare.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Probabilmente mi avrebbe odiato "
"per questo, ⟪k:18⟫ma avrei accettato volentieri il suo disprezzo, in cambio dei benefici che il "
"suo sangue avrebbe portato."

#: scenario8:scenario8_DA956642_2FAC_4EA6_98B5_99E9DC2909C5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7e8acd3b65eaf8ecc0d1adb99ebe8f61b429b09ec24ed51fc7bad8a0c96eee73
#. default-sha256: 12211842b920853422effa1cd9e796bb9cef1f819862adb8b357fb2a3c41647d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_DA956642_2FAC_4EA6_98B5_99E9DC2909C5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was no god. ⟪k:1⟫I was no saint.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I had blood on my hands—⟪k:5⟫I was a "
"villain.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫I knew no way to accomplish good... ⟪k:9⟫without doing bad."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non ero un dio. ⟪k:1⟫Non ero un santo.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Avevo le mani sporche di sangue—⟪k:5⟫"
"ero io il cattivo.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Non conoscevo alcun modo per fare del bene... ⟪k:9⟫senza fare "
"del male."

#: scenario8:scenario8_8597CA75_ADD2_4524_9F94_E5771B42ED32
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0fb9bf10d4590d77027b365aee1f968a6f6ce12d5d72ac68bafdeaec91ce0f4c
#. default-sha256: 827405d2986fb9fdd9e96ae3eed84f9fa4f38cd91d24ad66cd362137e834fdbe
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_8597CA75_ADD2_4524_9F94_E5771B42ED32"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫After the swordsman departed, I took some time to myself. ⟪k:1⟫I filled a goblet with water, "
"smelled it, then gave a bit of it to my pet dog before gulping down the rest of it.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫“Are you still out there somewhere, Morgana? ⟪k:6⟫What would you think of me... if you saw "
"what I had become?”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Dopo la partenza dello spadaccino, mi presi del tempo per me stesso. ⟪k:1⟫Mi versai "
"dell’acqua in un bicchiere, la odorai, e ne diedi un po’⟪k:2⟫al mio cane da compagnia, prima di "
"ingurgitare il resto.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫“Sei ancora lì da qualche parte, Morgana? ⟪k:7⟫Cosa "
"penseresti di me...⟪k:8⟫se vedessi cosa sono diventato?”"

#: scenario8:scenario8_B3CFCAF8_AE1C_4FDD_B4CB_78FD414B994E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e9fe2f20d1a95fd0bc3d9c7727e78cd425d7e26d63e6e703675bc2902186ab83
#. default-sha256: 5a53ec17ddfe1e1b7651f39d887bb60f7df903297d91d238a3f5a895549580d1
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B3CFCAF8_AE1C_4FDD_B4CB_78FD414B994E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Tell me you didn’t harm her, dog. ⟪k:1⟫I smell blood.”⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫“You only instructed "
"me not to kill her. ⟪k:5⟫Mistakes were made, limbs were lost.”⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫“............”⟪k:9⟫"
"⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫“I cleaned up all the blood I got on me. ⟪k:12⟫No one suspected anything.”⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫"
"⟪k:15⟫“............”⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫“That you were able to immediately recognize it as the "
"smell of blood says quite a bit, lord. ⟪k:19⟫You ⟪k:20⟫have⟪k:21⟫ killed before, haven’t "
"you?”⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫“Enough yapping. ⟪k:25⟫She ⟪k:26⟫is⟪k:27⟫ alive, yes?”⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫"
"⟪k:30⟫“Of course.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Dimmi che non le hai fatto del male, cane. ⟪k:1⟫Sento odore di sangue.”⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫“Mi "
"avevi solo ordinato di non ucciderla. ⟪k:5⟫Sono stati commessi degli errori, e lei ne ha pagato "
"le conseguenze.”⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫“............”⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫“Ho lavato via tutto il sangue che "
"avevo addosso. ⟪k:12⟫Nessuno ha sospettato nulla.”⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫“............”⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫“Il fatto che tu abbia riconosciuto immediatamente l’odore del sangue la dice lunga, lord. "
"⟪k:19⟫Tu hai ⟪k:20⟫già⟪k:21⟫ ucciso prima, non è così?”⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫“Finiscila di blaterare. "
"⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫È⟪k:27⟫ viva, almeno?”⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫“Certo.”"

#: scenario8:scenario8_4DAF8DE7_FF78_43F2_BEEC_78546A9B34BC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b087fb02f822ef8df01377f9ee7e50c7994e2f09c13df12482ec60a56acf5809
#. default-sha256: ce9dcf9f0bc1dec57148c95434c949fcf52d04b9146f07fa714bc76b55cf4405
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4DAF8DE7_FF78_43F2_BEEC_78546A9B34BC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As soon as I saw her, ⟪k:1⟫I knew ⟪k:2⟫exactly ⟪k:3⟫who the girl was.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫But why?"
"⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫What was ⟪k:10⟫she⟪k:11⟫ doing in the bag?⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Why was ⟪k:15⟫"
"she⟪k:16⟫ the lakeside witch?⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫What was ⟪k:20⟫she⟪k:21⟫ doing here?⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫"
"⟪k:24⟫Why was ⟪k:25⟫she⟪k:26⟫ so pale and shaking?⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫Why had I ordered ⟪k:30⟫"
"her⟪k:31⟫ captured?⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫⟪k:34⟫How could I have done that?⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫⟪k:37⟫⟪k:38⟫How could "
"I have let this happen to her?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non appena la vidi, ⟪k:1⟫capii ⟪k:2⟫immediatamente ⟪k:3⟫chi era.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Ma... perché?"
"⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Cosa ci faceva ⟪k:10⟫lei⟪k:11⟫ nella sacca?⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Perché era ⟪k:15⟫"
"lei⟪k:16⟫ la strega del lago?⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫Cosa ci faceva ⟪k:20⟫lei⟪k:21⟫ lì?⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫"
"⟪k:24⟫Perché era ⟪k:25⟫lei⟪k:26⟫ ad essere così pallida e tremante?⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫Perché avevo "
"ordinato di catturare ⟪k:30⟫lei⟪k:31⟫?⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫⟪k:34⟫Come potevo averlo fatto?⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫"
"⟪k:37⟫⟪k:38⟫Come potevo aver lasciato che le succedesse questo?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_4FFF9820_BD2D_4437_8C64_3746F809F6CA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d2e171ac8b5595cbfed195394efd199a4001ce7374b02e545098b5cbed0562c4
#. default-sha256: 8c262bae1801a9b539e16e0208d6e28e9d1392f77c6bce4752f73e6c1743bff6
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4FFF9820_BD2D_4437_8C64_3746F809F6CA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“You... You remember me...?”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Did Morgana remember me?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫The "
"three years we had spent together.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫What kind of person I had been.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫"
"⟪k:13⟫The boy who had refused to give up putting ointment on her face.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫Those "
"horribly unromantic encounters at the graveyard.⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫Her taking shots at me. Me "
"taking shots at her.⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫All that time we had shared..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Ti... Ti ricordi di me...?”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Morgana si ricordava di me?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"Dei tre anni che avevamo trascorso insieme.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Del tipo di persona che ero stato."
"⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Del ragazzo che non rinunciava ad applicare l’unguento sul suo viso.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫"
"⟪k:16⟫Degli incontri poco romantici al cimitero.⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫Delle frecciatine che ci "
"lanciavamo a vicenda.⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫Di tutto il tempo che avevamo condiviso..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_85949B79_C217_47F6_A9F7_C5C9EC61BC85
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 97928a58eb878bcd2ee994765ad38d309e7365c1b717e9a601ae58d4c013e840
#. default-sha256: 09c2b9dd2c41a3657b652c78a512fe2cb7493db0f8a96d938b8d90fe5a10502c
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_85949B79_C217_47F6_A9F7_C5C9EC61BC85"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“How could I ever forget...?”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Morgana... she remembered me?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"⟪k:8⟫“How could I ⟪k:9⟫ever⟪k:10⟫ forget all the pain and humiliation you put me through?! ⟪k:11⟫"
"How could I ⟪k:12⟫ever⟪k:13⟫ forget the blood sabbats you so ⟪k:14⟫loved⟪k:15⟫ to hold?!”⟪k:16⟫"
"⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫What— ⟪k:20⟫What was she talking about...?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Come potrei mai dimenticare...?”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Morgana... si ricordava di me?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
"⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫“Come potrei ⟪k:9⟫mai⟪k:10⟫ dimenticare tutto il dolore e l’umiliazione a cui mi hai "
"costretta?! ⟪k:11⟫Come potrei ⟪k:12⟫mai⟪k:13⟫ dimenticare i riti sanguinari che amavi "
"tanto?!”⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Cosa— ⟪k:18⟫Di cosa stava parlando...?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_120935B9_E782_41BD_95AE_B848EF739D0F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 437e75753108cf68c45084615fcebde403ccb9b0352b1e46ce6834c1813f93dc
#. default-sha256: 89addca3cd7c46d04b9ac4e3e74c8700333ed75f35c98177ae05b722cccfdb7e
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_120935B9_E782_41BD_95AE_B848EF739D0F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“I don’t care how much my Father preaches forgiveness... that’s the one thing you’ll never "
"get from me! ⟪k:1⟫I despise you with all my soul!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I revile you with every fiber of my "
"being! ⟪k:4⟫For every scar you gave me... ⟪k:5⟫I give you a lifetime of hatred!”⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫"
"⟪k:9⟫“No, Morgana—!”⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫“I was not aware you knew the witch, lord.”⟪k:14⟫"
"⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫His voice made my blood run cold.⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫I didn’t just ⟪k:21⟫"
"know⟪k:22⟫ her.⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫Morgana was—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Non m’importa quanto mio Padre predichi il perdono... quella è l’unica cosa che non otterai "
"mai da me! ⟪k:1⟫Ti odio con tutta l’anima!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Ti disprezzo con tutta me stessa! ⟪k:4⟫Per "
"ogni sfregio che mi hai inferto... ⟪k:5⟫riverso su di te l’odio di una vita intera!”⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“No, Morgana—!”⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫“Non sapevo che conoscessi la strega, "
"lord.”⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫La voce dell’uomo mi fece gelare il sangue.⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫Lei "
"non era una semplice ⟪k:21⟫conoscente⟪k:22⟫.⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫Morgana era—"

#: scenario8:scenario8_07639842_E4A2_4909_ABB6_3E0DC91EFFBA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 02435652043340b51555f3c7e08e8e52f187732a59e296d9a3a0554d47982bc4
#. default-sha256: c6fdded4ff4bc83c0e470c678c4f06b99d484a111755f96fb64e62bd61c3ab32
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_07639842_E4A2_4909_ABB6_3E0DC91EFFBA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“This man... The lord! ⟪k:1⟫He destroyed me, mind and body!”⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫No, that was "
"another man.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫He was already dead. I had just taken his place.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫I had "
"come from the slums. I had been part of the slaves’ revolt.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫I knew I had "
"to tell her—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Quest’uomo... Il lord! ⟪k:1⟫Mi ha distrutta, anima e corpo!”⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫No, si "
"trattava di un altro uomo.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Lui era morto. Io avevo solamente preso il suo posto."
"⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Ero originario dei bassifondi. Avevo fatto parte della rivolta degli schiavi."
"⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫Sapevo che dovevo dirglielo—"

#: scenario8:scenario8_50FBD350_6DF7_46D9_ADBD_6F3C5F82EB1F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cdd19d2c2bf81ef00646674b6ebfc1a0fb75513077f586b0b2bf3bc5bd05b7b2
#. default-sha256: 5cca228bcea865498af112e3e31ccd40add5c50d2f56987d078101a9040182a8
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_50FBD350_6DF7_46D9_ADBD_6F3C5F82EB1F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“He ruined my life!”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫—but between the sting of Morgana’s accusations and "
"my need to protect my current position, I couldn’t muster the strength to do it.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫If "
"someone were to find out I wasn’t legitimate royalty, ⟪k:8⟫that I had come from the slums..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Mi ha rovinato la vita!”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫—ma tra la raffica di accuse da parte di "
"Morgana e il mio bisogno di difendere la mia posizione, non riuscii a trovare la forza per farlo."
"⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Se qualcuno avesse scoperto che non ero affatto un nobile, e che venivo dai "
"bassifondi..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_7B92280B_08D4_41C0_8B72_37ADD123E484
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1572b760edade5888f93901357534a07c730f340c4dba5cf943d91ab5302a8c7
#. default-sha256: 57c33c10339d1ea9acaeecf10430539f8f9e358b912dab69ea6a7c884b6d6e79
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_7B92280B_08D4_41C0_8B72_37ADD123E484"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫then everything I had worked so hard to build up⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫To build up "
"for who, though?⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫would come crumbling down...⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫"
"⟪k:16⟫Do I really think it hasn’t already?⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫All I had left was my power, my "
"rank...⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫Is that what I actually wanted?⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫"
"I couldn’t afford to lose that too...⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫When did I—⟪k:37⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫tutto ciò che avevo costruito così duramente⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Costruito per chi?"
"⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫sarebbe crollato...⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫Cosa mi dice che non "
"fosse già successo?⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫Tutto quello che mi era rimasto era il potere, il mio "
"rango...⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫Era davvero questo ciò che volevo?⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫"
"⟪k:30⟫Non potevo permettermi di perdere anche quello...⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫Quand’è"
"—⟪k:37⟫"

#: scenario8:scenario8_8BD9B828_BDF2_4609_A71F_CA64605A8A69
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 01590af6ed49a2e71616489ae625b48b74b6a87d93a66e2423c4d3d12a6430b1
