msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫ever believe me..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫creduto qualcuno...?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_B4AAEB72_A2F4_46FC_B95A_56E8016326A2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 49093b40233cb99bd33567301a349eb8e497f4e236811b79e02a0993a2a7d1ca
#. default-sha256: d01e7c96b2f50b1c7d7d7e6bc7ce5594bd462f856f134f4a6141809a18516f07
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B4AAEB72_A2F4_46FC_B95A_56E8016326A2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Before me floats a man, twisted and writhing in "
"pain.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Although, whether what I’m looking at could be said to resemble a “human” "
"is a difficult question.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫It’s a hazy, indistinct shape, ⟪k:16⟫on the precipice "
"of being consumed by darkness everlasting.⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫I know very well what I’m looking at—"
"⟪k:20⟫the moments before a man’s soul shatters."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Dinanzi a me fluttua un uomo che si contorce "
"dal dolore.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Anche se mi risulta difficile dire se ciò che sto guardando possa "
"essere considerato “umano”.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫È⟪k:17⟫ una sagoma confusa e indistinta, ⟪k:18⟫"
"ad un passo dal venire consumata dall’oscurità senza fine.⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫So benissimo cosa sto "
"vedendo—⟪k:22⟫questo è ciò che avviene prima che l’anima di un uomo vada in frantumi."

#: scenario8:scenario8_6EDDA1CB_F4CC_477D_AB58_9A8B01666872
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1c39b2a21e6eef793784f35f83dc9e206a97bd30e1daa7914d65394858c044f6
#. default-sha256: 609960e321f644607a3141ffdde462fb3d0786bd602a5d24808573c9668ec110
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_6EDDA1CB_F4CC_477D_AB58_9A8B01666872"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Did I do the same thing to him... ⟪k:1⟫that Morgana did to me?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Was it I who "
"summoned the darkness?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Who laid his past bare.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Who forced him to "
"relive those events, ⟪k:11⟫to experience once more everything he felt, everything he thought."
"⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Who put him through that despair a second time.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫I can only "
"imagine how he must have felt... ⟪k:18⟫causing someone he once cared for so much pain.⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫"
"⟪k:21⟫The things he did are abhorrent, more than deserving of reproach—⟪k:22⟫and it would "
"undoubtedly be easier for him to simply vanish into the eternal abyss."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ho fatto a lui la stessa cosa... ⟪k:1⟫che Morgana ha fatto a me?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Sono stato io "
"ad evocare la tenebra?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Ad aver messo a nudo il suo passato.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Ad "
"averlo costretto a rievocare quegli eventi, ⟪k:11⟫a rivivere ogni sua emozione, ogni suo pensiero."
"⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Ad averlo sottoposto a quella disperazione una seconda volta?⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"Posso solo immaginare cosa lui abbia provato... ⟪k:18⟫nel causare tanto dolore a una persona a "
"cui teneva.⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫Le sue azioni sono abominevoli, più che meritevoli di rimprovero—"
"⟪k:22⟫e sarebbe indubbiamente più facile per lui svanire nell’abisso senza fondo."

#: scenario8:scenario8_CD55D19C_1210_429C_A8EE_AEF6FFA17DC0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4412338fde3178bd298a39afc444c17f352bfec8280fcffbd3629d09b7814bba
#. default-sha256: 01961fb10fa991e91bb4f00d14d6d5b2eb21ffbe3baf5ef9a0c4fff5c1920883
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_CD55D19C_1210_429C_A8EE_AEF6FFA17DC0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But I can’t allow that to happen.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫He still has work to do.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫His "
"story is essential.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫It’s almost certain Morgana still doesn’t know who he really is."
"⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫He needs to face her, ⟪k:13⟫to reveal the truth with his own words. ⟪k:14⟫"
"That’s the only way we’re going to get her to have a change of heart."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma non posso permettere che questo accada.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Lui ha ancora altro da fare.⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫La sua storia è essenziale.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫È⟪k:11⟫ quasi certo che Morgana non "
"sappia ancora chi lui sia veramente.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Lui deve affrontarla, ⟪k:15⟫deve "
"raccontarle la verità lui stesso.⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫È⟪k:20⟫ l’unico modo che abbiamo per "
"farle cambiare idea."

#: scenario8:scenario8_7F51DB19_6F09_4C9D_AAF1_ACD6102191EF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 12066261a4a2f44f19e36a71443c6910d5dda77554d4efe451d85ac76561ff3e
#. default-sha256: 965f69037e8593fb04e7e948592553da41973892edd7a44ae54f6af43a8be2d7
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_7F51DB19_6F09_4C9D_AAF1_ACD6102191EF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫That’s not all he has to say to her, either.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫So I must bring him back, pull "
"him out of the darkness."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E non è nemmeno l’unica cosa che deve dirle.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Perciò devo riportarlo indietro, "
"e tirarlo fuori dall’oscurità."

#: scenario8:scenario8_550BE920_6ED2_4351_B1B1_B67077623447
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1be71c1d4c0b97a345e87f50c51351c0156c982f3bc9e05b02bcb3ba4ec13099
#. default-sha256: 952749d9fc7d56f9bd855e7bf0a0fa22c277f1c7baa5393bf901c5e8b50089ae
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_550BE920_6ED2_4351_B1B1_B67077623447"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I grab the man by the arm and begin scouring the blackness for an exit.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫After "
"some time, I see a speck glistening high above, ⟪k:4⟫so I make my way upwards.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Back "
"into the harsh light of the real world."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Afferro l’uomo per un braccio e inizio a perlustrare le tenebre⟪k:1⟫in cerca di un’uscita."
"⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Dopo diverso tempo, scorgo un puntino luminoso sopra di noi,⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫al che mi "
"faccio strada verso l’alto, fino a raggiungere la luce pungente del mondo reale."

#: scenario8:scenario8_16416566_5BFE_4607_820D_F0A338F7B0DB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
