msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫.................."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫.................."

#: scenario8:scenario8_5AD2E860_A5D1_4D0E_A441_21ED1B447000
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f12a2adfe2fee97ab6cb32ceffedc4568cb45b6dec35c15b51132c74c595b615
#. default-sha256: 97294ebbb3c289d86c88ad70cd94b65cd1a896138dadb1e940636297b0e3bdc8
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_5AD2E860_A5D1_4D0E_A441_21ED1B447000"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The man is still straddling me, dagger held above his head,⟪k:1⟫just as he had been before "
"our trek into his past.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫His eyes are open wide, and his hand is trembling."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫L’uomo è ancora rivolto verso di me, col pugnale sollevato sopra⟪k:1⟫la testa, nella stessa "
"identica posizione in cui si trovava prima che entrassimo nei ricordi del suo passato.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫"
"Ha gli occhi spalancati, e gli trema la mano."

#: scenario8:scenario8_4273DA75_2931_4D97_AFAC_4206E24832A0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 78155c348a4da856f5eedc142ad00849bdb2b3aa3dfd0113ba436dadb9bd4b6d
#. default-sha256: 9c1b5d593665776d1952442c8875f6545a64e67fff90852dcd5344482daec959
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4273DA75_2931_4D97_AFAC_4206E24832A0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫A few moments later, his fingers go slack, and the blade slips from his grasp, piercing the "
"wood floor by my face."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Pochi istanti dopo, la sua presa si allenta, facendo scivolare la lama.⟪k:1⟫ Questa colpisce "
"il pavimento, a pochi centimetri dal mio viso."

#: scenario8:scenario8_9CA830CD_1A7F_4811_B255_6755AF204D05
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 96193ac7f2045fabfa7da8ec99fcda98d2f586aec0ac8c1661559a04fc03443f
